  "origin": "spec",
  "description": "At the end of the day, every call that ended with no recording and no outcome is marked a no-show (the no-show recovery starts from there). For companies where every held call is recorded; turn it off for one that isn't. A closer's own answer on the end-of-day form overrides it.",
  "definition": {
